exit: 1
bin: BIN
description: Read and operate an AxeOS Bitcoin miner from a predictable command line
error:
  code: saved_host_invalid
  message: the saved host file HOSTFILE does not hold one address in the form that `host save` writes; no host is read from it
help: axeos-axi host forget removes the file; then axeos-axi host save <address>; --host <address> or AXEOS_HOST names the miner without the file
